==============================================================================
WHAT THIS DOES NOT SETTLE
==============================================================================
  The synthetic llama and ice bag are crude silhouettes drawn by this
  script. Recovering them shows the pipeline works on THAT shape; it does
  not show it would catch a hand-painted llama in a crowded scene, and no
  absence claim here is stronger than its control.
  Nothing in this sweep revives the words form of the hypothesis, which is
  closed on the wordlist alone, and nothing in it grades the locator/order
  form above [UNTESTED]: a hit would be an object in a painting, not a
  measured link to a slot or a word.
